# reasons of a probe, a stop at a removal, a missing secret, the dispatcher
# of Windows) use pod_core::text. A typed failure keeps its io::Error as
# the source; a consumer says its chain with pod_core::text::plain. The
# refusal of a printed unit of a pair that is not there (0fc86408, its
# T-1024) and the absolute path of a file flag (text.rs) are of podssh's
